# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Michael MacIsaac et al. (2024). A Genetic Algorithm Trained Machine-Learned Interatomic Potential for the Silicon–Carbon System.
#   The Journal of Physical Chemistry C. doi:10.1021/acs.jpcc.4c02205  arXiv:2403.15897v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2403.15897v1 (sha256 8193a37e63b66371...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
