# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/macisaac2024.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the UF3 potential for Si-C (custom knot strategy)
# trained on 41,225 PBE structures (41,145 from GASP genetic-algorithm
# searches across the Si-C composition space, 80 from AIMD), with its
# stated energy and force RMSEs. Mechanical properties, equations of state,
# melting and surface reconstruction are properties, not error metrics.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
